It is four o'clock in the evening.
We are in the office pantry.
Suresh, Prakash, Deepa, and Arun are drinking tea with me.
We are not talking about work now.
Suresh asks me a question.
"Maya, which places in Kerala have you visited?" he asks.
"I have visited Fort Kochi and the backwaters," I reply.
Deepa smiles and looks at me.
"Have you eaten snacks from the bakeries here?" Deepa asks.
I nod my head happily.
"Yes, I have eaten banana fritters and meat puffs," I say.
"Have you eaten banana chips?" Arun asks.
"Anitha has given me banana chips," I reply.
"They are very tasty," I add.
Prakash tells a funny story about a bakery.
We all laugh loudly.
The tea time is over.
We go back to work.
